1	// sc4sap:program-to-spec — Template-clone xlsx renderer.
2	//
3	// Strategy (양식 보존 / format-preserving):
4	//   1. Read asset/template_base.xlsx (canonical reference workbook —
5	//      English-source ZMMRTEST003 spec with all styles, borders, fonts, column
6	//      widths, row heights, drawings, images intact).
7	//   2. Re-zip every entry byte-for-byte EXCEPT xl/sharedStrings.xml.
8	//   3. For xl/sharedStrings.xml, replace each <t>…</t> content using the
9	//      user-supplied translation map TR { "English key": "한국어 값" }.
10	//   4. Write the resulting xlsx to outPath.
11	//
12	// Why this exists:
13	//   The previous workflow built xlsx geometry from JSON (SHEETS_DATA + custom
14	//   styles), which silently drifted from the agreed reference format. By
